5,1,1,talk,May,,I pulled the use tally. It’s not about the room; it’s about who gets to decide. Who else checked the numbers?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I checked the partition wall. It’s just plasterboard. Sound travels easily.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,I am looking into the facilities callouts and the invoices for outside hire. We must understand the true cost of our current habits before deciding.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I’m checking the lunch round trip and the old fridge clear-out! I want to see if we actually need a kitchen or just a place to chat.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m checking the unplanned talk and where the last awkward conversation happened. We need a place to actually talk to each other properly.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, that plasterboard detail is a game-changer. It means privacy is basically impossible right now.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, exactly. That is why I looked at the crumbs and bins too. The mess is just as loud as the noise.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Misaki, the noise and mess are symptoms. I am tracing where the hours go. Who is actually doing the upkeep?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, I found the lunch trip takes twenty-five minutes! That’s why we need a kitchen. Also, half the old fridge was empty, so we really do need space.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
